        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6e106ad0-737c-4c9a-b2e4-d966142caeec\",\"review_text\":\"Can't pick specific songs to play. Says you get 30 minutes no ads after watching ads but then gives you more ads 10 minutes later.\"},{\"review_id\":\"26ebc91a-2790-4bea-ac63-4edb9f996394\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"bfa5936c-26af-49ce-a7ed-2dda4c421ba6\",\"review_text\":\"I'm Moslem , you didn't our religion Islam\"},{\"review_id\":\"1d13fcf1-5a08-4178-8434-64b4372e354d\",\"review_text\":\"Land login nhi ho raha\"},{\"review_id\":\"9f0e484a-b7d0-47bd-b5eb-18809f7795d7\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this application\"},{\"review_id\":\"0bf68fb6-2ebc-4035-a0ce-1e306b44f0e9\",\"review_text\":\"It abruptly stops and can't play songs anymore. Also, i tried the mini premium paid for it 2x yet i wasn't able to have the said 1 day subscription. Didn't went through the hassle of figuring out the problem. Waste of time.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7e51f58b-54da-4820-9536-d253d3007112\",\"review_text\":\"The new update made this app unsusable with the premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"310c9889-b37a-403b-80f3-cf47160d4b2e\",\"review_text\":\"தேவையில்லாத விளம்பரங்கள்\"},{\"review_id\":\"5b313019-3d14-4ab7-9d68-a9a1942c12e8\",\"review_text\":\"Stop shuffle . Stop to buy premiums\"},{\"review_id\":\"793103cf-c137-40cd-9419-57fe5cf6fb57\",\"review_text\":\"التطبيق حلو ♥️✨\"}]}"
